      "role": "user",
      "content": "the sprite metaphor is a bit much for a professional report lol. can we stick to the technical side? also, if we do see that precipitation happening, what are the specific indicators or visual signs in the vines that we should look for to know if the iron or manganese uptake is actually failing?",
